{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07511","headline":"王昭君歌 · 刘长卿","name":"王昭君歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"自矜娇艳色，不顾丹青人。\n那知粉绘能相负，却使容华翻误身。\n上马辞君嫁骄虏，玉颜对人啼不语。\n北风鴈急浮云秋，万里独见黄河流。\n纤腰不复汉宫宠，双蛾长向胡天愁。\n琵琶弦中苦调多，萧萧羌笛声相和。\n谁怜一曲传乐府，能使千秋伤绮罗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07511.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07511","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}